<title>USA: Ohio Capital for Housing yields 7.657 pct in 2022.</title>
<headline>Ohio Capital for Housing yields 7.657 pct in 2022.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sturges Co said it priced $2.625 million of Ohio Capital Corp for Housing, taxable mortgage revenue refunding bonds, Series 1996C &amp; 1996D, with a top yield of 7.657 percent in 2022.</p>
